1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,880
One worn part can stop a favorite routine.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,003
My frappé maker's agitator is worn.

3
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:15,630
The app asks which device it came from,
and the label under the base answers.

4
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:20,755
Search the web brings back the maker's
part, and Check

5
00:00:20,875 --> 00:00:25,880
fit turns every unknown into a question
for the seller.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,441
For my unused electronics, Muse Spark
proposes builds from what I own.

7
00:00:32,561 --> 00:00:37,929
I pick a homework workstation and draw it,
and what

8
00:00:38,049 --> 00:00:42,880
is missing becomes a Marketplace search I
run myself.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,880
The connection diagram is a concept
preview of the next step.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,956
Orphan Parts Lens.

11
00:00:50,076 --> 00:00:51,380
Find replacements.

12
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,804
Discover reuse.

13
00:00:52,924 --> 00:00:54,880
Build something useful.

